== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Magic Skin|Magic Skin]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod.
* The item is a reference to the 1831 book by French novelist [[wikipedia:Honoré de Balzac|Honoré de Balzac]] called ''[[wikipedia:La Peau de chagrin|La Peau de chagrin]]'', known in English as ''The Wild Ass's Skin''. In the story, the main character finds a talisman made of donkey skin that grants wishes, but each wish causes the talisman to become smaller, as well as his lifetime. He attempts to get rid of the skin, but it always finds a way to return to him.
** The item's pickup quote, "All your desires fulfilled", is the first sentence written on the skin in the novel.
* This also may be a reference to the goatskin Jacob uses to trick his father Isaac into thinking he was Esau, thus giving him his blessing along with the divine right God had promised Abraham (Isaac's father), which included inheriting the promised land and having his bloodline bring forth the Messiah.

